message: "Please cite this research software and the original UCI dataset when using the code or derived electricity data. A Zenodo DOI will be added by the author after archival."
type: software
title: "Diagnosing temporal pooling in neural forecasting: predictive information and loss geometry — research code and evidence"
authors:
