abstract: "Research software and complete current core evidence for an analytical and controlled empirical study of temporal access in neural forecasting. Includes attributed derived UCI data, synthetic examples, source-selected checkpoints and full forecasts, post-review theory and statistical extensions, and all 120 unsuccessful source-only extension fits. This is not a successful new compression codec or a state-of-the-art architecture claim. Data and artwork licenses are specified separately in DATA_LICENSE.md."
